  "citation": "Kim J; Wilson S; Myers-Pigg A; Bociu I; Kemner K; Regier P; Rich R; Kew W; Megonigal J P; Bailey V; Ward N (2025): Data for Kim et al., \"Variations in the optical and molecular composition of dissolved organic matter exported from coastal wetlands\". COMPASS-FME. Dataset. doi:10.15485/3001080",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
